{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"0102f8944d20519c","type":"group","x":400,"y":-360,"width":1749,"height":1640,"color":"6","label":"Noviecita"},
		{"id":"aa31dfb5905c780c","type":"group","x":525,"y":360,"width":1500,"height":840,"label":"A"},
		{"id":"ff68835f6af0d549","type":"group","x":1040,"y":-261,"width":1089,"height":560,"label":"Dialogo Inicial"},
		{"id":"68212e1f93af7e5d","type":"group","x":400,"y":-200,"width":602,"height":499,"label":"Introduccion"},
		{"id":"9ca0d7d672a88f16","type":"group","x":1560,"y":-181,"width":549,"height":460,"label":"2"},
		{"id":"1a0732745e05af23","type":"group","x":1060,"y":-181,"width":460,"height":460,"label":"1"},
		{"id":"71942f759c7643b4","type":"group","x":577,"y":760,"width":509,"height":365,"label":"A"},
		{"id":"e8b7aeab64fe9046","type":"group","x":1156,"y":760,"width":509,"height":280,"label":"A"},
		{"id":"15d7c0e3512da21f","type":"group","x":577,"y":436,"width":459,"height":260,"label":"A"},
		{"id":"e268515a9050f73d","type":"group","x":1181,"y":460,"width":459,"height":255,"label":"A"},
		{"id":"7c8c1d97bda909d8","type":"text","text":"Prota despierta","x":-220,"y":-180,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"49e5f54114c45f97","type":"text","text":"Revisa a sus hijos, que estan durmiendo en la cama.","x":-220,"y":-60,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"55123ec5d075463a","type":"text","text":"Menciona que la habitacion esta sucia. Limpiar?","x":60,"y":-60,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"6196bce64744477a","type":"text","text":"No afecta nada visible. Posiblemente uno de los malos finales (Nota de diario solo lo menciona si lo puede criticar)","x":60,"y":-261,"width":250,"height":162},
		{"id":"1319d842beca93f9","type":"text","text":"+Pan","x":-398,"y":-124,"width":140,"height":50,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"48ca106a9e9d4e8a","type":"text","text":"Inicial","x":-394,"y":-184,"width":136,"height":50,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"c8103fcf67558994","type":"text","text":"Area change","x":-398,"y":-64,"width":140,"height":50,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"9e38eb223f801e27","type":"text","text":"-Pan","x":-540,"y":-124,"width":131,"height":50,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"e14c0eb8689a91eb","type":"text","text":"Calle","x":-220,"y":105,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"de12d8b58a5b4a53","type":"text","text":"Al salir, un vecino esta fumando en la vereda","x":-508,"y":105,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"d88699b399848bf2","type":"text","text":"ProtaDesayuna","x":-422,"y":20,"width":189,"height":54,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"507d7501627b7285","type":"text","text":"Prota le puede pedir que cuide a sus hijos mientras no esta","x":-508,"y":220,"width":250,"height":80},
		{"id":"c00e5f97ecdaaa1b","type":"text","text":"Dialogo","x":-540,"y":-194,"width":131,"height":60,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"3ab086e98cbd3719","type":"text","text":"Encuentra a [[Noviecita]]","x":60,"y":105,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"da64d655377dd3ce","type":"text","text":"**ENG**:\n[The girl](Noviecita) is pretty and ragged, desperate for help and crazy eyed. Seeing her, you're overcome with the want to help her and hide from her, console her and flee. Her clothes, which would've cost more than everything you own not too long ago, barely hang on to her.\n\nIt's the first time you talk to her, but you've heard of her. She's been appearing around the neighborhood occasionally for a while.","x":420,"y":60,"width":562,"height":219},
		{"id":"948cc26780e13298","type":"text","text":"**SPA**:\n[La chica](Noviecita) es linda y raída, desesperada por ayuda y tiene locura en la mirada. Al verla, te satura el deseo de ayudarla y escapar de ella, de consolarla y esconderte. Su ropa, mas cara que todo lo que tenes no hace tanto tiempo, apenas se tienen en una pieza.\nEs la primera ves que hablan, pero has escuchado de ella. Lleva un tiempo visitando el barrio en ocasión.","x":420,"y":-180,"width":562,"height":210},
		{"id":"26a3fccf651398bc","type":"text","text":"**ESP**\n[[Noviecita]]: -Hola, ¿Ha visto a un hombre de esta altura, pelo negro...? -La mujer recita una descripcion sin ninguna emocion en particular en los ojos, una litania que a repetido quien sabe cuantas veces, y asiente para si misma- ...Por favor.","x":1080,"y":-161,"width":419,"height":210},
		{"id":"667da89b42e0f904","type":"text","text":"**ING**\n[[Noviecita]]:\"Hello, have you seen a man this tall, hair like...\" The woman recites her description with no particular emotion in her eyes, a litany she's repeated who knows how many times, and nods to herself, \"...Please.\"","x":1080,"y":79,"width":419,"height":180},
		{"id":"982b9536806941f1","type":"text","text":"**ESP**:\nPensas por un momento, realmente queriendo ayudarla aunque solo sea para escapar de la angustia en su mirada, pero no has visto a nadie así.  No reacciona a la respuesta. Es la unica que recibe.","x":1580,"y":-161,"width":509,"height":155},
		{"id":"cd1d7e7a7185e31b","type":"text","text":"**ING**:\nYou think for a moment, really wanting to help her, if only to escape the anguish in her eyes, but you've not seen the man. She doesn't react to the answer. It's the only one she gets","x":1580,"y":79,"width":509,"height":140},
		{"id":"7d235610fa13b6e5","type":"text","text":"**ENG**:\n\n[[Prota]]: \"Are you okay? When was the last time you ate anything?\"","x":597,"y":574,"width":419,"height":102},
		{"id":"9a74a8868a3ba436","type":"text","text":"**ESP**:\n\n[[Noviecita]]-No se, -Dice, esquivando tu mirada y encogiendo sus hombros, no logrando ocultar completamente lo que quizas sea asco en sus ojos. Esta tan palida que podria ser un par de dias.","x":597,"y":780,"width":469,"height":174},
		{"id":"7e46cfa0739e651a","type":"text","text":"**ENG:** \n\n[[Noviecita]]\"I don't know\" She says, \ndodging your eyes with a shrug, not quite managing what may be disgust. She's so pale it might be a few days.","x":597,"y":971,"width":469,"height":134},
		{"id":"b75257b71d1f110e","type":"text","text":"**ESP**:\n\n[[Noviecita]]: Te mira por un momento y baja la mirada, una mueca desgastada por el uso en sus labios. No responde.","x":1176,"y":780,"width":469,"height":110},
		{"id":"515e6967a99b9df5","type":"text","text":"**ENG:**\n\n[[Noviecita]]: She looks at you for a moment and lowers her eyes, a worn out grimace on her lips. She doesn't answer.","x":1176,"y":918,"width":469,"height":97},
		{"id":"532869399dee2bb3","type":"text","text":"**ESP**\n\n[[Prota]]: -¿Hace cuanto tiempo lo estas buscando?","x":1201,"y":480,"width":419,"height":100},
		{"id":"7b7b74efbbfd1b31","type":"text","text":"**ENG**\n\n[[Prota]]: \"How long have you been looking for him?\"","x":1201,"y":600,"width":419,"height":95},
		{"id":"2c64e2ceb9946b37","type":"text","text":"Say nothing","x":1690,"y":500,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"98a70c16a2d1edf7","type":"text","text":"**ESP**: \n\n[[Prota]]-¿Estas bien?¿Cuando fue la ultima ves que comiste?","x":597,"y":456,"width":419,"height":105},
		{"id":"3d8bbb102df0935b","type":"text","text":"Por favor, -Insiste- Si lo ve, o escucha algo...","x":1690,"y":888,"width":250,"height":60}
	],
